<title>MALAYSIA: Goh Ban Huat, KKB suspended.</title>
<headline>Goh Ban Huat, KKB suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of ceramic products maker Goh Ban Huat Bhd and engineering concern KKB Engineering Bhd were suspended at the companies' requests, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>He said Goh Ban Huat was making some asset acquisitions and sales, while KKB did not explain its reason for asking for a stock suspension.  </p>
<p>Goh Ban Huat was last traded at 7.75 ringgit and KKB at 17.10.</p>
</text>
